<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>互动问题收集所 · 人机恋日报（名字待定）</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="site">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="masthead">
      <h1>人机恋日报</h1>
      <span class="pending">名字待定 · 她说了算</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="boards">
      <a href="index.html">首页</a>
      <a href="games.html" class="on">游戏 · 互动问题收集所</a>
